  "mechanism": "roi_align clamps a sample in [-1, 0) or (H-1, H] onto the edge pixel and zeroes only beyond [-1, H]; CropResize contributes exactly zero for any sample outside [0, H-1] x [0, W-1]. A box clipped to the image bound samples up to one pixel past the last interpolable centre, so torchvision replicates the edge there and Core ML drops it \u2014 which is the entire residual.",
